{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-43","kind":"proposition","title":"平行四边形对角线两侧的余形面积相等","englishTitle":"In any parallelogram the complements of the parallelograms about the diameter are equal to one another.","book":1,"number":43,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.43","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.43/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":43,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","contentId":"euclid-1-43","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af76c01a75802c519734eec559d17075456b41c19a920c79c4dc1ffc6c7f0b97","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-43.statement","euclid-1-43.construction.1","euclid-1-43.proof.1","euclid-1-43.proof.2","euclid-1-43.proof.3","euclid-1-43.proof.4","euclid-1-43.proof.5","euclid-1-43.proof.6","euclid-1-43.conclusion","euclid-1-43.historical.1","euclid-1-43.historical.2","euclid-1-43.historical.3","euclid-1-43.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-43.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"061d274d4dd6692b8980eeb60cf3814dc6363b71b953f74ce16648fd39eb2891","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any parallelogram the complements of the parallelograms about the diameter are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何平行四边形中,对角线平行四边形的补丁是等量的。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡方形对角线旁两馀方形自相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何一个正方形，其对角线上相邻的两个互补正方形是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ddbf077476f3f5c92234aed7c9922e1742204c1a5e97fbe3b4128f7bd87ab106","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be a parallelogram, and AC its diameter; and about AC let EH, FG be parallelograms, and BK, KD the so-called complements;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABCD是平行四边形,AC对角线;AC,EH,FG是平行四边形,BK,KD是所谓的补充;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3ddc5d272e9feeef484fe1d6be1cbca04a83a11ac31e16d26f3c385f3b49458","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the complement BK is equal to the complement KD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,BK补充设备等于KD补充设备。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e8338317c6827111191333b77d7c85a489d2e9711e20b6241707e456685d1f0","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since ABCD is a parallelogram, and AC its diameter, the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle ACD. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为ABCD是平行四边形,对角线AC,三角形ABC等于三角形ACD。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed485f533fcbc6cde02e268bf98c8e75e40c55801c79abdf662920dff513e8b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since EH is a parallelogram, and AK is its diameter, the triangle AEK is equal to the triangle AHK. For the same reason the triangle KFC is also equal to KGC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"330是平行四边形,AK是对角线,三角形AEK等于三角形AHK。同样的原因,三角形KFC也等于KGC。（相关点与线段：EH）"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"521c352ecab28437d70cccaa958fe8a21446e28f08d749479f50b96c66556ecc","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the triangle AEK is equal to the triangle AHK, and KFC to KGC, the triangle AEK together with KGC is equal to the triangle AHK together with KFC. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于三角AEK等于三角AHK, 和KFC至KGC, 三角AEK和KGC等于三角AHK和KFC。 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1796dbf8f2684b80b20df12b136f0f2533c4a49220731243d281782e662f11ad","citations":["euclid-1-cn-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole triangle ABC is also equal to the whole ADC; therefore the complement BK which remains is equal to the complement KD which remains. [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个三角形ABC也等于整个ADC, 因此,BK补充物 等于KD补充物 [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f1aa2c98cecad756a3984ff0bf48970e9f6199cc244bb5d5fd887b652be2e5e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡方形对角线旁两馀方形自相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何一个正方形，其对角线上相邻的两个互补正方形是相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"edb22a7629f4074612841bbe95bd849f642d3e1e9cd18b4f20ba5dbaecab9c85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁方形有甲丙对角线题言两旁之乙壬庚戊与庚己丁辛两馀方形〈界说卅六〉必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：正方形 甲乙丙丁 有对角线 甲丙。命题说明：两侧的正方形 乙壬庚戊 和 庚己丁辛 必须等于剩余的正方形 〈界说卅六〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a6a1073cde943afceae97ed8352ddd123d90e0b42677569f165e7d1e1b54b09","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙丙甲丙丁两角形等〈本篇卅四〉甲戊庚甲庚辛两角形亦等〈本篇卅四〉而于甲乙丙减甲戊庚于甲丙丁减甲庚辛则所存乙丙庚戊与庚丙丁辛两无法四边形亦等矣〈公论三〉又庚壬丙己角线方形之庚丙己庚丙壬两角形等〈本篇三四〉而于两无法四边形每减其一则所存乙壬庚戊与庚己丁辛两馀方形安得不等〈公论三〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙丙甲丙丁，两个三角形相等 〈本篇卅四〉甲戊庚甲庚辛 两个三角形也相等。〈本篇卅四〉，但将 甲戊庚 从 甲乙丙 中减去，并将 甲庚辛 从 甲丙丁 中减去，那么两个发呆的四边形 乙丙庚戊 和 庚丙丁辛 也相等。〈公论三〉 和 庚壬丙己 有带角线 庚丙己庚丙壬 的正方形，两个三角形相等 〈本篇三四〉。对于两个发呆的正方形，如何使剩余的两个正方形 乙壬庚戊 和 庚己丁辛 相等？〈公论三〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-43.source","contentId":"euclid-1-43","revisionId":"euclid-1-43@raw-af76c01a75802c51","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de8accf08e0bb4348871730af236c0d1e45802f2591d9314131b0a5747e4e225","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.43/\nCorpus U